<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai, Daewoo deny news of joint M&amp;A of Kia.</title>
<headline>Hyundai, Daewoo deny news of joint M&amp;A of Kia.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two South Korean automakers, Hyundai Motor and unlisted Daewoo Motor, on Wednesday denied a news report that they had agreed to a jointly take over the ailing Kia Motors.</p>
<p>&quot;Such an agreement has not been made,&quot; said Lee Young-bok, a spokesman at Hyundai Motor.</p>
</text>
